OL,3,GNEWSAGirls as young as five targeted   
OL,4,Afor upskirting as charges continue to  
OL,5,Arise                                   
OL,7,FGirls as young as five have been       
OL,8,Ftargeted for upskirting, new police    
OL,9,Ffigures show.                          
OL,11,FOver the past three years, Wales' four 
OL,12,Fforces received 219 complaints from    
OL,13,Fpeople up to the age of 87, with 18    
OL,14,Fpeople charged, results of Freedom of  
OL,15,FInformation (FOI) requests reveal.     
OL,17,FUpskirting involves taking a photo or  
OL,18,Fvideo beneath someone's clothing -     
OL,19,Fwithout their knowledge - with the     
OL,20,Fintention of viewing their genitals,   
OL,21,Fbuttocks or underwear.                 
