OL,3,GNEWSAGirls as young as five targeted   
OL,4,Afor upskirting as charges continue to  
OL,5,Arise                                   
OL,7,FIt was made a criminal offence under   
OL,8,Fthe Voyeurism (Offences) Act 2019 and  
OL,9,Fcarries a maximum sentence of two years
OL,10,Fin prison.                             
